2. Geo data (geoip.dat / geosite.dat)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files   : geoip.dat, geosite.dat
Source  : https://github.com/v2fly/geoip, https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community
License : CC-BY-SA 4.0 / MIT depending on dataset (see upstream repositories)

Geo data is treated strictly as a *data asset*, downloaded at runtime or bundled
unmodified. It is never compiled into MyVpn. MyVpn stores it in a user-writable
directory, records its SHA-256 and provenance, and never modifies the file
contents. Attribution and licence text accompany any redistributed copy.

