4. NuGet dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
All NuGet dependencies are permissively licensed (MIT / Apache-2.0) and are
pinned centrally in Directory.Packages.props. Notable ones:

  * Avalonia UI            — MIT
  * CommunityToolkit.Mvvm  — MIT
  * Microsoft.Extensions.* — MIT
  * xunit / Shouldly       — Apache-2.0 / MIT (test-only)

A machine-readable dependency inventory is produced by the CI
`license-scan` job (see .github/workflows/ci.yml).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Redistribution checklist for release artifacts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Before publishing any artifact that bundles third-party binaries or data:
  1. include the upstream LICENSE text for Xray-core;
  2. include the upstream LICENSE/attribution for geo data;
  3. include this NOTICE file;
  4. record the exact upstream version + SHA-256 of every bundled binary in
     `artifacts/manifest.json`.
